{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_01_end",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_01",
  "title": "火山製造",
  "storyCode": "OF-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3fefb64c5b9a764523c4d26c905dac62fd425a218f46820116428602c50ba3fb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_hotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "原來是這樣......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是如此，我們在火山腳下的森林裡，碰到了錫蘭小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有必要把你們解救我之前的過程描述得這麼詳細嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得這位大小姐說得對，而且大尾巴你是不是還提到了你覺得我很麻煩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，啊，是你的錯覺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不管怎麼說，大家平安無事就好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，那麼，雖然比較晚了，請容我正式自我介紹一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的名字是錫蘭·道爾科斯，維多利亞國立大學畢業，專攻方向是源石研究，也是這座城市市長的女兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "市長的女兒？！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰會想到市長的女兒會獨自去未開發的火山林地呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也是因為不得不做一些學者必須要去嘗試的冒險......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "繼續說回到剛才在火山腳下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳、咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你們，陌生人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，你為什麼會一個人來這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果只是在沙灘上散步的話，你走得稍微有些遠了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，從你身上帶的工具來看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "普羅旺斯，她也和我們一樣，是來查看狀況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，是這樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帶著筆記，卻穿著洋裝和靴子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是單純的傻子的話，那就只能是————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忽然產生了靈感，忘記換衣服直接衝出家門，等遇到了麻煩才發現穿著問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不記得因為這樣的事情燒毀過多少裙子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，我覺得這似乎不是應該用理所當然的口吻來描述的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姑且不論裙子的事情，大致上你的判斷沒有錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該說什麼好呢，這麼做還是有些危險的哦......沒有準備完全的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事。只要我在，哪怕是兩手空空出門也會很安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之，謝謝你們救了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等回到市內時，可以來找我，我會報答你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但抱歉，現在我很忙，我有重要的事要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦哦原來你還有事，那就不耽誤你時間了，不過最好還是不要獨自再去火山那裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛才才被這些源石蟲襲擊了，一個人很危險的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，剛才的事我認為只是個意外。當時我急著上山了，沒有注意附近情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在這座城市長大，如果這裡的源石蟲真的有那麼危險，那市長應該早就採取對策了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呃，好吧。不過，我覺得，或許它們的聚集是有原因的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡一直都是這樣，怎麼會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，因為環境改變帶來的狂躁化......原來如此，謝謝你，我的證據又多了一條！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......普羅旺斯，看起來她和你發現了一樣的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我對火山沒有那麼熟悉，但是作為一名專業而全面的學者，大致的瞭解還是有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道說，你們也是來尋找證據的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尋找這座火山可能會爆發的證據？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_hotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "火山爆發？！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "開玩笑吧？！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特殊的刺激性氣味，加上異常的氣溫、狂躁化的源石蟲....."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且在火山周圍能遇到這種感染生物，說明這火山也不太一般。要知道如果這山內有源石的話，礦業開採商可是會擠破頭的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火山的實際情況並沒有多少人知道，而且通常也被市政廳和相關機構管理著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為環境改變帶來的生物狂躁化......至少對比以前的狀況，我多少也能對現在的異變有些猜測。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了保障市民和城市的安全，我一直在到處尋找對此方面有專業經驗的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望你們務必要幫助我，幫助我讓汐斯塔市度過這個難關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
